Rules:
------
1) No patching!! - The nature of the functions make this too trivial.
2) Serial fishing is ok, and the ability to do so is part of the design.
   No obfuscation or encryption is used on the code itself.


Goals:
------
1) Write a KeyGen!
2) Serial fish... if you must.
3) Write up an excellent tutorial for other to learn from!!


